{"overview":"جزایر کناری به آخرین پناهگاه اروپا پس از شیوع ویروس TSJ تبدیل شده‌اند. وقتی مأموریت ویژه‌ای برای یافتن مواد غذایی حیاتی به سرزمین اصلی می‌رود، رُبِرتو به تیم می‌پیوندد، اما نیت‌های او مشکوک است. عملیات خطرناک به مسابقه‌ای دلسوزانه برای بقا تبدیل می‌شود و رُبِرتو و همراهانش در میان هردو گروهی از آلوده و وفاداری‌های تقسیم‌شده گرفتار می‌شوند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The Canary Islands have become Europe’s last refuge following the outbreak of the TSJ virus. When a special mission sets out for the mainland in search of vital supplies, Roberto joins the team with questionable intentions. The dangerous operation turns into a desperate race for survival, and Roberto and his companions find themselves caught between hordes of infected and divided loyalties.","tagline_en":"","runtime":96,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Carles Torrens"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["ES"],"cast":[{"name":"Carlos Alcaide","role":"Roberto","photo":"/rl8fxgvKu56zxf5kIMGVTX3ju7Q.jpg"},{"name":"Julia Martínez","role":"Marina","photo":"/kkw8za1vSW4uLXBdakwbFLO7TCU.jpg"},{"name":"José María Yázpik","role":"Pritchenko","photo":"/GEV4PnIhxAAPxIHvsyhdLUjnSv.jpg"},{"name":"Mónica López","role":"Castro","photo":"/7Gm2h0ApsorCUJhUA8gUtxrWzMd.jpg"},{"name":"Tamara Casellas","role":"Comillas","photo":"/nCXGGmFP7pyNrdUtrsDUIOVjyc.jpg"},{"name":"Berta Vázquez","role":"Lucía","photo":"/2QNOI5L03XomONmCR42GPyVYryy.jpg"},{"name":"Santiago Vaca Narvaja","role":"Core","photo":"/sXJgtXMQkwfno6J9BpC3V50awG1.jpg"},{"name":"Mario Mayo","role":"Comandante De Luna","photo":"/xzEjSgLCkrwQ1HZ7OY6CbSNM9wM.jpg"},{"name":"Javier Godino","role":"González-Escalona","photo":"/qwXxX6gKIphuCXJ2wgeROPjIdic.jpg"},{"name":"Pedro Hernández","role":"Guzmán","photo":"/fCqOynLjB8pqLTxGoiGnX0yeJIV.jpg"},{"name":"Axel Medrano","role":"Manuel","photo":""},{"name":"Kevin Ramos","role":"Rodríguez","photo":""}],"trailer":"BIEzwpyawtw","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1507696-apoca